            <div xml:id="d199">

                <pb facs="0713" n="674" xml:id="pg674"/>

                <head>199. Telegram From the Embassy in Italy to the Department of State<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d199-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Rome</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1970-11-03T11:12:00+00:00">November 3, 1970,
                        1112Z</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>6311. Subject: Chirec.</p>
                <p>1. Foreign Ministry Secretary General Gaja
                    has requested Chargé to call on him at 7:00 p.m. this evening, Rome time. GRC
                    Ambassador has been asked by Gaja come at
                    6:00 p.m. We understand from separate source that purpose is to inform GRC
                    Ambassador and US of GOI’s intention to
                    announce recognition PRC.</p>
                <p>2. Final Paris meeting now scheduled for tomorrow, November 4, to confirm and
                    sign joint communiqué. If no hitches develop, recognition announcement will take
                    place November 6.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed corresp="#p_SW_2">
                        Stabler
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
